# CS 1.6's HUD, second part (specs/cs16/hud.md; cs16_ui::hud): the dynamic
# crosshair at rest and after a burst, the weapon selection open on slot 1
# (hud_fastswitch 0), and the round timer. The window's size picks the
# layout (320 under 640 pixels wide, else 640). Launch with a match limit
# so the timer shows (it flashes reddish at 20 s or less; the scene's last
# shot is near 15 s):
#   CHIMERA_CS16_ROOT=<install> cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1920x1080 +volume 0 \
#       +mp_timelimit 40 +sandbox cs16:de_dust2 --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/cs16_hud2.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 2
wait_for idle
wait 120
rung cs16:weapon_ak47
wait 120
shot cs16_hud2_rest
+attack
wait 20
shot cs16_hud2_firing
-attack
wait 120
cs16:hud_fastswitch 0
wait 5
slot1
wait 3
shot cs16_hud2_menu
cancelselect
gwait 17
shot cs16_hud2_timer
